Kimochi Manga OCR
Native Rust inference and page grouping for Manga OCR and Comic Text Detector.

Manga OCR: https://github.com/kha-white/manga-ocr (Apache-2.0)
Model: kha-white/manga-ocr-base, revision aa6573bd10b0d446cbf622e29c3e084914df9741
Apache license retained in LICENSE-APACHE.

Comic Text Detector: https://github.com/dmMaze/comic-text-detector (GPL-3.0)
Source revision 440b978563c71b758e31aaa315d100faba1efa2f.
ONNX weights distributed by zyddnys/manga-image-translator, beta-0.2.1.
Pinned asset provenance and checksums: scripts/model-manifest.json.
This combined library is distributed under GPL-3.0-only. Test manga imagery
is not bundled or licensed by this project.

Kimochi also includes MeikiOCR (Apache-2.0), ported from rtr46/meikiocr
revision 52aa607ecdc1038c7bf390f37cd9a8b306e8a08a. Its models and ONNX
Runtime carry their own licenses in the bundled meikiocr resource directory.

Dictionary engines
Kimochi does not include any pop-up dictionary engine. When you choose one,
Kimochi downloads that engine's own, unmodified release asset from its
upstream GitHub release, checks it against a pinned SHA-256 and every
unpacked file against a pinned hash list (extensions/<id>.source.json and
extensions/<id>.sha256.json in Kimochi's source), and runs it unmodified.
Each engine's licence and notices are part of that download; its source is
the upstream tag named below. All three are licensed GPL-3.0-or-later.

Yomitan: https://github.com/yomidevs/yomitan (GPL-3.0-or-later)
Not included in Kimochi. When you choose it, Kimochi downloads release
26.8.24.0 (commit 77e200428902abf4fa48284df92da7af3dcb4162, asset
yomitan-chrome.zip, SHA-256
99d3ac05e09b09d19b1ecd22da2ebca4fc8cfce1d95d029b5a18d87aff632147) from
