10ten Japanese Reader: https://github.com/birchill/10ten-ja-reader
(GPL-3.0-or-later). Not included in Kimochi. When you choose it, Kimochi
downloads release v1.28.0 (commit 05e9fe2815de2eb1c7807b3d7bebdef456cbb5d1,
asset 10ten-ja-reader-1.28.0-chrome.zip, SHA-256
9ce5dcf9930c6dbb5988dbb25e088150dcd77d70cfee70af448df5c8420cbede) from
