Its dictionary data (data/ in the download, and the updates it fetches) is
derived from the JMdict, KANJIDIC and ENAMDICT/JMnedict files of the
Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group
(https://www.edrdg.org/), used in conformance with the Group's licence,
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0. Kimochi shows this data in its
own windows.
